      "title": "FP-4 Distractor Susceptibility: Prioritize Explicitly Named Entities Over List Position",
      "class": "FP-4",
      "context": "When retrieving a specific code from a set of provided options, the agent must strictly match the entity name requested in the query to the entity name in the source log, ignoring the order of options or the presence of other valid codes in the list.",
